# Keep line endings deterministic across platforms.
#
# git apply tolerates CR at the end of ordinary patch lines, but NOT on the
# "\ No newline at end of file" marker line. A Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true converts patches/*.patch to CRLF, which then makes the
# only no-trailing-newline hunk (packages/ui/src/assets/icons/file-types/
# folder-environment.svg in version.patch) fail with "patch does not apply".
# Pin the patch files (and the scripts) so they are always checked out with LF.
*.patch text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
VERSION text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
